              <field>
                <name>SWAP_BANK</name>
                <description>Bank swapping option status bit
SWAP_BANK reflects whether Bank1 and Bank2 are swapped or not.  
SWAP_BANK is loaded to SWAP_BANK of FLASH_OPTCR after a reset.</description>
