This bit can be set only with VDDIO2 below 2.7�V.</description>
                <bitOffset>17</bitOffset>
                <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
                <access>read-write</access>
                <enumeratedValues>
                  <enumeratedValue>
                    <name>B_0x0</name>
